  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wetlands Alliance 2009-14 - Wetlands Alliance 2009-12</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Wetlands Alliance 2009-14</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Four regional partners: Asian Institute of Technology, WWF, WorldFish Center and CORIN/University of Songkla. In addition, some 40 local    partners that implement local level activities in Cambodia, Lao PDR   and Vietnam. Some capacity building activities takes place in         Thailand. The programme focus on strengthening of aquatic resources   management and associated livelihoods improvements.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fyra regionala partner: Asian Institute of Technology, WWF, WorldFish Center och CORIN/University of Songkla. Ut&#xf6;ver dessa &#xe4;r 40 lokala     partners involverade och implementerar p&#xe5; lokal niv&#xe5; verksamhet i     Kambodja, Laos PDR och Vietnam. Viss kapacitetsuppbyggnad/verksamhet  &#xe4;ger rum i Thailand. Programmet fokuserar p&#xe5; f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkning av          akvatiska resursf&#xf6;rvaltning och tillh&#xf6;rande utkomst f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar.</narrative>
  </description>
